17:03.160 --> 17:05.670
<b>5,000,000 yen</b>

17:03.160 --> 17:05.670
<b>Aoba Tsukuyo</b>

17:03.500 --> 17:05.670
That was my first.

17:06.140 --> 17:08.040
You'd better take responsibility for that.

17:08.040 --> 17:10.300
For real?!

17:12.900 --> 17:14.550
We're back.

17:14.550 --> 17:16.050
Welcome back.

17:15.520 --> 17:16.480
It's so cold.

17:16.480 --> 17:18.150
I've just returned.

17:18.650 --> 17:21.850
Please allow me to rejoin your temple.

17:21.850 --> 17:24.310
Whatever, just get inside.

17:24.310 --> 17:28.430
Ts-Tsukuyo-san? What's he still doing here?

17:28.430 --> 17:32.560
Oh, you know. I figured it'd be 
all right if he just lived here.

17:32.560 --> 17:34.090
Thank you.

17:35.870 --> 17:37.320
Mia?!

17:38.020 --> 17:39.690
What's wrong with her?

17:39.690 --> 17:41.330
She's got issues.

17:41.660 --> 17:45.080
More importantly, let's take 
a bath. Tsukuyo, join me.

17:45.080 --> 17:48.140
That's right! Your clothes are 
see-through from the rain—

17:47.830 --> 17:48.250
No, they're not!

17:48.250 --> 17:49.790
No, they're not!

17:48.740 --> 17:50.400
Don't mind me.

17:50.400 --> 17:55.340
And call me Tsukuyo.
That nickname you use is weird.

17:55.340 --> 17:57.460
U-Understood.

17:58.350 --> 18:01.260
Welcome back, Tsukuyo-oneechan.

18:01.260 --> 18:02.590
Kurage.

18:02.590 --> 18:05.230
Akagami-san, you're back, too.

18:05.530 --> 18:08.730
Embarrassingly, yes, Miss Third Daughter.

18:08.730 --> 18:11.070
Kurage is "Miss Third Daughter" now?

18:11.070 --> 18:14.390
Yuzuki-oneechan said she'd 
wait for you in the bath.

18:14.950 --> 18:16.860
Well, not like there's any rush.

18:17.320 --> 18:20.860
She's normally so level-headed. 
What's got her so excited?

18:21.710 --> 18:25.620
Yeah, she used to be stupider.

18:26.580 --> 18:29.530
She was carefree, impulsive,

18:29.530 --> 18:33.220
and wouldn't have a thought in her head 
even when she seemed to be thinking.

18:31.600 --> 18:33.220
Kurage, stop.

18:34.660 --> 18:38.810
Maybe Yuzu-nee wasn't as 
sharp as she is now, but...

18:38.810 --> 18:39.820
Useless?

18:39.820 --> 18:41.400
Useless, huh?

18:41.400 --> 18:44.300
Yeah, you're really starting 
to give me a headache.

18:44.300 --> 18:46.020
You mustn't say that, Miss Third Daughter.

18:46.630 --> 18:49.200
You shouldn't speak about your sister that way.

18:49.200 --> 18:50.270
Yeah, that's right.

18:50.560 --> 18:53.520
Yuzuki-san is simply a meathead.

18:53.880 --> 18:55.590
You'd better watch yourself, too.

18:55.590 --> 18:58.080
Tsukuyo, hurry up!

18:58.080 --> 19:00.300
Okay, Yuzu-nee.

19:00.780 --> 19:03.340
I'm really off my game these days.

19:02.320 --> 19:05.200
Tsukuyo-oneechan's a little 
bit in love with her sister.

19:05.790 --> 19:08.040
Well, would you look at the time?

19:08.470 --> 19:11.290
Miss Third Daughter, I'm going 
to make dinner. Would you—

19:12.790 --> 19:14.100
I'll help.

19:15.540 --> 19:21.070
Anyway, when you said earlier that 
Yuzuki-san used to be dumb and useless...

19:21.070 --> 19:22.350
It's true.

19:22.350 --> 19:24.300
I can't imagine it.

19:24.640 --> 19:28.030
Of course not. You've only just met her.

19:28.030 --> 19:29.560
I suppose you're right.

19:29.900 --> 19:32.310
<i>But I really want to know!</i>

19:32.590 --> 19:35.440
<i>No, that's ridiculous. It'd be 
an invasion of her privacy.</i>

19:35.940 --> 19:37.570
<i>But then again...</i>

19:37.570 --> 19:41.070
<i>There's seventeen years of Yuzuki-san 
that I don't know yet.</i>

19:41.070 --> 19:43.880
And I want to learn everything 
as soon as possible!

19:43.880 --> 19:45.370
You want to spy on them in the bath?

19:45.370 --> 19:46.860
Where did that come from?

19:46.860 --> 19:49.080
You said you wanted to know everything.

19:49.080 --> 19:51.080
I accidentally said that out loud!

19:51.390 --> 19:54.680
No, I didn't mean anything so insolent by that.

19:54.680 --> 19:58.340
Besides, this is a temple. Such insolence 
would be punishable by death.

19:58.820 --> 20:01.840
Being pervy isn't a bad thing.

20:02.790 --> 20:04.570
Wh-Why not?

20:04.570 --> 20:05.850
Because you're human.

20:05.850 --> 20:07.600
Because I'm human?

20:07.940 --> 20:10.600
Even the Buddha has children.

20:10.940 --> 20:13.280
I'm the child of a monk, too.

20:13.280 --> 20:14.850
In other words, a man and a woman had—

20:14.850 --> 20:16.360
Stop, Miss Third Daughter.

20:16.980 --> 20:20.300
Yuzuki-oneechan is probably pervy, too.

20:20.300 --> 20:20.860
Wha—

20:21.310 --> 20:23.840
A closet perv.

20:23.840 --> 20:24.860
Closet?

20:24.860 --> 20:27.620
So I don't think she'd be mad 
if you peeped on her.

20:27.970 --> 20:30.660
No, wait. That logic doesn't make sense.

20:30.660 --> 20:32.500
<i>Th-This girl...</i>

20:32.780 --> 20:36.020
<i>She's so innocent, 
but that makes her so dangerous!</i>

20:36.500 --> 20:39.340
Uh, um...

20:39.340 --> 20:40.750
I'm joking.

20:40.750 --> 20:41.390
Eh?

20:41.390 --> 20:46.140
Teasing people like this used 
to be Yuzuki-oneechan's job.

20:46.520 --> 20:51.140
But ever since then, she's been perfect.

20:51.140 --> 20:55.800
Tsukuyo-oneechan started 
growing up little by little, too.

20:57.090 --> 21:01.150
But since you showed up, 
they've been acting a little dumb again.

21:02.650 --> 21:05.410
I like them better when they're dumb.

21:05.860 --> 21:09.910
So I'm glad you came back.

21:10.790 --> 21:11.990
Thank you.

21:14.940 --> 21:16.790
<i>What a nice girl!</i>

21:16.790 --> 21:19.070
You don't need to thank me!

21:19.070 --> 21:23.080
So to thank you, I'll show you.

21:23.080 --> 21:23.920
What?

21:24.280 --> 21:26.180
Everything about them.

21:26.180 --> 21:28.300
No, wait! Miss Third Daughter!

21:28.300 --> 21:30.810
Stop!

21:29.410 --> 21:30.010
Twirl.

21:46.450 --> 21:50.720
You shouldn't tease Akagami-kun so much.

21:50.720 --> 21:52.110
Okay.

21:52.110 --> 21:56.190
Do you understand, 
Miss Third Daughter? No pervy stuff.

21:58.630 --> 22:00.960
You seem to be having fun.

22:00.960 --> 22:01.960
However!

22:02.330 --> 22:06.220
This temple has fallen into depravity
because of you, Akagami!

23:44.940 --> 23:59.950
<b>Next Time

I'll Castrate You</b>

23:45.270 --> 23:48.490
Akagami saw something 
that would embarrass any girl.

23:48.490 --> 23:50.350
What? You mean...

23:50.350 --> 23:52.700
He saw me lick off the 
ice cream stuck to the lid.

23:52.700 --> 23:55.620
Oh, you had me worried. I thought 
you were talking about something else.

23:56.020 --> 23:58.160
Besides that, all he saw was my chest.

23:58.160 --> 23:59.590
Akagami-kun?!
